% Lord of the Mysteries (fate-simulator Module 10). "Outside a die's event, a hook already in play does not chase the character
% (no knock at their door, no messenger, no blocked road leading back); it goes on off-stage": no_chase.
no_chase.
kind(case, news).          kind_text(case, "a case the police or a church's beyonder squad is quietly working").
kind(gathering, person).   kind_text(gathering, "a beyonder gathering or a dealer in ingredients").
kind(cult, threat).        kind_text(cult, "a cult or heretic ritual").
kind(artifact, item).      kind_text(artifact, "a rumour of a sealed artifact or a mystical item").
kind(losing_control, threat). kind_text(losing_control, "someone losing control").
kind(stranger, person).    kind_text(stranger, "a stranger").
kind(canon_afar, canon).   kind_text(canon_afar, "a canon figure seen from afar").
kind(city, place).         kind_text(city, "the city or the weather or the newspaper").
kind(price, price).        kind_text(price, "the price of something done before").
kind(ordinary, news).      kind_text(ordinary, "work or rent or a letter from ordinary life").
